          "title": "You'll want to know: a geada",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "a geada — \"the frost\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "De manhã, a relva estava branca de geada. In the morning, the grass was white with frost."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cair geada — to frost over."
